{"id":"n73400-1-25","stage":1,"title":"다치다 · 受伤","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73400-1-25-1","ko":"엄마, 집에 오다가 넘어져서 무릎을 다쳤어요.","zh":"妈妈，我回家路上摔倒了，膝盖受伤了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오다가","meaning":"经由，途经","explanation":"오다：经由，途经；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"22","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넘어져서","meaning":"跌倒，倒下，摔倒","explanation":"넘어지다：跌倒，倒下，摔倒；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"넘어지다","audio":"/audio/b95cf11ab79489dac5a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62363","senseId":"1","lemma":"넘어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무릎을","meaning":"膝盖","explanation":"무릎：膝盖；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"무릎","audio":"/audio/a088ec9c747fb05fd92c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55313","senseId":"1","lemma":"무릎","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다쳤어요.","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"经由，途经","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"经过某条路，向这边移动。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"b95cf11ab79489da","term":"넘어지다","zh":"跌倒，倒下，摔倒","audio":"/audio/b95cf11ab79489dac5a0.mp3","entryId":"62363","definition":"站立着的人或物失去重心，倾向一边而倒下。","pronunciation":["너머지다"]},{"id":"a088ec9c747fb05f","term":"무릎","zh":"膝盖","audio":"/audio/a088ec9c747fb05fd92c.mp3","entryId":"55313","definition":"大腿和小腿中间向前凸出的呈圆形的部分。","pronunciation":["무릅"]},{"id":"128510caa5a5a0b6","term":"다치다","zh":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3","entryId":"73400","definition":"被撞到或被打后身上或身体的一部分出现伤口；或指使出现伤口。","pronunciation":["다치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9ef18852fb1a233476a6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73400-1-25-2","ko":"저런, 피가 많이 나는구나. 얼른 약을 바르자.","zh":"哎呀，血流得真多。快涂点药吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저런,","meaning":"啊，哎呀","explanation":"저런：啊，哎呀","readings":[{"term":"저런","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71224","senseId":"1","lemma":"저런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"피가","meaning":"血，血液","explanation":"피：血，血液；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"피","audio":"/audio/9c6661386be05570418b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73269","senseId":"1","lemma":"피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나는구나.","meaning":"流","explanation":"나다：流；는구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"18","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼른","meaning":"快地","explanation":"얼른：快地","readings":[{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67315","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"약을","meaning":"药","explanation":"약：药；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"약","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72379","senseId":"1","lemma":"약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바르자.","meaning":"抹，搽","explanation":"바르다：抹，搽；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"바르다","audio":"/audio/3b42ecf8717cc7fd3927.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62652","senseId":"1","lemma":"바르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2f66dcda6095507e","term":"저런","zh":"啊，哎呀","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3","entryId":"71224","definition":"听到没料到的、惊奇或可惜的事情时说的词语。","pronunciation":["저런"]},{"id":"9c6661386be05570","term":"피","zh":"血，血液","audio":"/audio/9c6661386be05570418b.mp3","entryId":"73269","definition":"循环于人或动物体内血管的红色液体，其作用为供给氧气和养分、运输排泄物等。","pronunciation":["피"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"流","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"身上流出汗、血、泪水等。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"d658f46882498576","term":"얼른","zh":"快地","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3","entryId":"67315","definition":"不拖延时间就。","pronunciation":["얼른"]},{"id":"2a9db5dfd1480367","term":"약","zh":"药","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3","entryId":"72379","definition":"为了治疗、预防病患或伤口，服用、抹、注射的物质。","pronunciation":["약"]},{"id":"3b42ecf8717cc7fd","term":"바르다","zh":"抹，搽","audio":"/audio/3b42ecf8717cc7fd3927.mp3","entryId":"62652","definition":"把液体或粉末等置于物体表面揉擦，使其被均匀涂抹。","pronunciation":["바르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/575eb8d010f788fd8001.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.372,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73400","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":34,"sequenceScore":1.5302,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["妈妈，我回家路上摔倒了，膝盖受伤了。","哎呀，血流得真多。快涂点药吧。","午饭吃什么好呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["妈妈，我回家路上摔倒了，膝盖受伤了。","哎呀，血流得真多。快涂点药吧。","午饭吃什么好呢？"],"answer":1}]}
